   {
    "day": 10,
    "text": "📓 Codex: you've heard of **Long Table**. Someone, somewhere, can do this. Now you know its name."
   },
   {
    "day": 10,
    "text": "⬢ SYSTEM: \"Neural depth 40. I've been watching what you're becoming, little living. Names for your shelf: Photosynthesis, Long Table. What they DO — that's still yours to learn.\""
   },
   {
    "day": 21,
    "text": "\"Your understanding is... deepening! We can see it! Like watching a seed decide to be a tree! Beautiful! Profitable!\""
   },
   {
    "day": 21,
    "text": "✦ Nino has found something — Surgeon's Calm. Days of triage and steady_hands side by side, and now they move as one. (surgeons_calm: villager synergy discovered)"
